From 10d7b2065b37f95f0c07d0e49d6ae0e0ce803c33 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 16:03:25 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Signature stance finishers for the Proving Grounds (building
 slice 11)

Each of the 10 signature stances unlocks one finisher while the Proving
Grounds is chartered: spend all Edge (at least 5) on a move of that
stance's character.

- ManeuverDefinition.Stance: a stance-bound finisher, no weapon class.
- ManeuverRegistry: ForStance index; validator for stance finishers and
  the new effect keys status, self_shield, ally_shield, all_adjacent.
- Technique tray offers the active signature stance's finisher; the
  arm/resolve gate refuses it in any other stance; switching stance
  disarms it.
- Data/Maneuvers: killing_feint, oath_unbroken, through_the_gap, anvil,
  landslide, called_shot, curtain_of_arrows, winds_eye, long_patience,
  hail_of_shafts.
- training_grounds.json and TrainingGrounds header: finisher text.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RF7HNp6pvyXiAz229q52Px
